# Canonical Turtle for the protocol-derived encoding of:
#   Jamal Abdul Nasir et al. (2025). Modelling silica using MACE-MP machine learnt interatomic potentials.
#   Physical Chemistry Chemical Physics. doi:10.1039/d5cp01882j  arXiv:2411.00436v1
#
# Version read: arxiv-preprint arXiv:2411.00436v1 (sha256 d249a58a17413761...);
