# Generated by artifacts/scripts/encode_paper.py from artifacts/kg/encoding/specs/nasir2025.yaml.
#
# Encoding scope: the pretrained MACE-MP-0 medium model (0b 'agnesi'
# release, L=1, 6 A cutoff, 10 Bessel functions, two layers) with an
# empirical D3 correction, used for geometry optimisation of zeolite
# frameworks and silica polymorphs (janus-core, ASE). Results are
# relative framework energies, formation-enthalpy changes and transition
# pressures compared with DFT, interatomic potentials and experiment,
# which are properties.

